    {"id":"owner-rule-text","type":"text","x":1788,"y":70,"width":1844,"height":54,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":2104,"version":1,"versionNonce":3104,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1789320000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a4","text":"ИНВАРИАНТ · Ровно один Response Owner и одно активное место ответа. До acknowledged отвечает Staffy; после acknowledged — человек; возврат владения всегда явный.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":50,"containerId":null,"originalText":"ИНВАРИАНТ · Ровно один Response Owner и одно активное место ответа. До acknowledged отвечает Staffy; после acknowledged — человек; возврат владения всегда явный.","lineHeight":1.25},
